*======================================================================*
* GPSS DATA PROCESSING UTILITY - MAIN CONTROL                       *
*======================================================================*

BLOCKSIZE 80

title  DATA_PROCESSING_PIPELINE

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 1. GENERATE INITIAL EVENTS                                     *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
INITIAL EVENTS
   GENERATE    -1,,100       * Simulate arrival of 100 records
   SAVE        1,1           * Keep the generator active

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 2. VALIDATION STAGE                                              *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Move the transaction to the Validator Facility (Simulated)       *
   QUEUE       VALIDATION_Q  * Wait for validator
   ENTER       VALIDATOR_F   * Check-in to Validator

* Simple validation logic: Check if field 1 is numeric (simulated)*
   SET         1, 1          * Mark as valid initially
   IFN         1, 0, SKIP    * Skip if not valid (simulated condition)
   TRANS       VALID_PASS, VALID_FAIL

VALID_PASS
   LEAVE       VALIDATOR_F   * Check-out from Validator
   QUEUE       PROCESS_Q     * Move to Processing Queue
   ENTER       PROCESSOR_F   * Check-in to Processor

   * Processing logic: Transform data (simulated)                   *
   ADD         2, 10         * Add some value to simulate transformation
   LEAVE       PROCESSOR_F   * Check-out from Processor
   QUEUE       REPORT_Q      * Move to Reporting Queue
   ENTER       REPORTER_F    * Check-in to Reporter

   * Reporting logic: Count processed items                         *
   COUNT       REPORT_COUNTER
   LEAVE       REPORTER_F    * Check-out from Reporter

* Failure handling                                                   *
VALID_FAIL
   LEAVE       VALIDATOR_F   * Check-out (failure)
   QUEUE       REJECT_Q      * Move to Reject Queue
   BLOCK       0             * Wait (simulated end)
   DELETE       1            * Delete the transaction (failed record)

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 3. CONTROL FLOW & TERMINATION                                    *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*

* Start the simulation clock                                     *
   START       1

* Facility Definitions                                             *
   FACILITY    VALIDATOR_F   * Validator Resource
   FACILITY    PROCESSOR_F   * Processor Resource
   FACILITY    REPORTER_F    * Reporter Resource

* Queue Definitions                                                *
   QUEUE       VALIDATION_Q
   QUEUE       PROCESS_Q
   QUEUE       REPORT_Q
   QUEUE       REJECT_Q

* Counters                                                         *
   COUNT       REPORT_COUNTER

   ENDSKIP

END
